        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=14;" value="&lt;b&gt;Communication summary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Users reach the frontend ALB using its AWS DNS name.&lt;br&gt;2. The frontend ALB distributes requests across two React/Nginx instances.&lt;br&gt;3. The React application calls the backend ALB DNS name.&lt;br&gt;4. The backend ALB distributes API requests across two Nginx/Node.js instances.&lt;br&gt;5. Backend services read and write persistent data in MongoDB Atlas." vertex="1">
